      "title": "I See You🥺",
      "subtitle": "The Monster Inside Me",
      "mood": "Tender",
      "excerpt": "Maybe I don't know what you have been through,\nMaybe I don't know all the pain inside you.\nBut I can see the hurt you tried to hide,",
      "body": "Maybe I don't know what you have been through,\nMaybe I don't know all the pain inside you.\nBut I can see the hurt you tried to hide,\nAnd I wish you didn't have to keep it inside.\n\nYou called it a monster living within,\nBut I see the heart that was hurt from within.\nYou never wanted to become this way,\nYou were just trying to survive another day.\n\nMaybe the words were never said in time,\nMaybe the pain was hidden between every line.\nBut you don't have to carry it all alone,\nEven a heavy heart deserves a home.\n\nI won't judge the things you couldn't say,\nOr blame you for the person you became that day.\nI just wish you could see what I can see,\nThere's more to you than the monster you believe.\n\nAnd if the scars still hurt sometimes,\nI'll understand even without the lines.\nI can't promise to take all your pain away,\nBut I'll be here, if you need someone to stay.\n\nSo don't be afraid of the monster inside,\nYou don't always have to run or hide.\nMaybe all it ever wanted was to be heard,\nTo be understood, without a single word.\n\nScars that cannot be seen  but only be felt."
